## Pre-Flight Checks

Before deploying, verify:

```bash
# 1. SSH access to all machines (from jumpserver)
{% for role, host in hosts.items() %}
ssh {{ host.fqdn }} hostname
{% endfor %}

# 2. Target directory is writable
{% for role, host in hosts.items() %}
ssh {{ host.fqdn }} "mkdir -p {{ base_path }}/{{ role }} && echo OK"
{% endfor %}

# 3. OpenSSL available on all machines
{% for role, host in hosts.items() %}
ssh {{ host.fqdn }} "openssl version"
{% endfor %}
```

## Deployment Order

Deploy in this order to avoid connection failures:

### Step 1: CA Certificate (all machines)

```bash
{% for role, host in hosts.items() %}
ssh {{ host.fqdn }} "mkdir -p {{ base_path }}/ca"
scp ca/ca.pem {{ host.fqdn }}:{{ base_path }}/ca/
{% endfor %}
```

### Step 2: MySQL

```bash
scp -r mysql/ {{ hosts.mysql.fqdn }}:{{ base_path }}/
ssh {{ hosts.mysql.fqdn }} "chmod 600 {{ base_path }}/mysql/certs/*.key*; chown mysql:mysql {{ base_path }}/mysql/certs/*"
# Merge mysql/config/ssl.cnf.snippet into /etc/my.cnf (or /etc/mysql/mysql.conf.d/ssl.cnf)
ssh {{ hosts.mysql.fqdn }} "systemctl restart mysqld"
ssh {{ hosts.mysql.fqdn }} "mysql -e \"SHOW VARIABLES LIKE '%ssl%'\""
```

### Step 3: RabbitMQ

```bash
scp -r rabbitmq/ {{ hosts.rabbitmq.fqdn }}:{{ base_path }}/
ssh {{ hosts.rabbitmq.fqdn }} "chmod 600 {{ base_path }}/rabbitmq/certs/*.key*; chown rabbitmq:rabbitmq {{ base_path }}/rabbitmq/certs/*"
# Merge rabbitmq/config/rabbitmq-ssl.conf.snippet into /etc/rabbitmq/rabbitmq.conf
ssh {{ hosts.rabbitmq.fqdn }} "systemctl restart rabbitmq-server"
ssh {{ hosts.rabbitmq.fqdn }} "rabbitmq-diagnostics listeners"
```

### Step 4: Keystone

```bash
scp -r keystone/ {{ hosts.keystone.fqdn }}:{{ base_path }}/
ssh {{ hosts.keystone.fqdn }} "chmod 600 {{ base_path }}/keystone/certs/*.key*"
# Merge keystone/config/apache-ssl.conf.snippet into Apache vhost
ssh {{ hosts.keystone.fqdn }} "a2enmod ssl headers && systemctl restart apache2"
curl --cacert ca/ca.pem https://{{ hosts.keystone.fqdn }}:5000/v3
```

### Step 5: Backend

```bash
scp -r backend/ {{ hosts.backend.fqdn }}:{{ base_path }}/
ssh {{ hosts.backend.fqdn }} "chmod 600 {{ base_path }}/backend/certs/*.key* {{ base_path }}/backend/stores/*.p12"
# Update application.yml with values from backend/config/application-ssl.yml.snippet
# Restart all backend services
```

### Step 6: Frontend

```bash
scp -r frontend/ {{ hosts.frontend.fqdn }}:{{ base_path }}/
ssh {{ hosts.frontend.fqdn }} "chmod 600 {{ base_path }}/frontend/certs/*.key* {{ base_path }}/frontend/stores/*.p12"
# Update application.yml with values from frontend/config/application-ssl.yml.snippet
# Restart all frontend services
```

## Quick Deploy (Automated)

```bash
# From the directory where this bundle was extracted:
chmod +x scripts/distribute-certs.sh
./scripts/distribute-certs.sh

# Verify:
chmod +x scripts/verify-certs.sh
./scripts/verify-certs.sh
```

